  "high_level_description": "Design a landscape infographic in digital vector graphic form, centered on a donut chart. The chart shows incident counts by neighborhood district.\n\nThe dominant <chart 4> occupies the middle left. Inside it, <legend 8> establishes the principal quantitative field and internal chart structure.\n\nUse <text 2> and <text 3> as the editorial entry point in the upper right, with a clear hierarchy of scale, weight, and spacing. Additional context comes from <image 41> at the middle right, <text 45> at the lower left, and <shape 40> at the center of the canvas.\n\nThe final look should feel clean, technical, and data-forward with a focus on readability and hierarchy, set against a flat full-canvas field. Maintain a flat editorial light treatment, allowing only restrained shadows to distinguish raised elements.",
